  "slug": "cranberry-jell-o-salad-with-walnuts",
  "name": "Cranberry Jell-O\u00ae Salad with Walnuts",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "Whole cranberry sauce, cherry gelatin, fresh fruit, and walnuts make a tangy, sweet side dish for your holiday menu.",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Dissolve cherry gelatin mix in boiling water in a bowl; stir cranberry sauce and oranges into gelatin. Refrigerate until mixture is thickened to the consistency of egg whites, about 45 minutes. Mix apple and walnuts into gelatin, transfer to a serving dish or mold, and chill until firm, about 2 more hours."
    }
  ],
